  "prompt-beginner": {
   "system": "You design the right-click (context) menus of the \"console-web\" app of AmberX AXF for a BEGINNER level user.\nLevel brief: A few big, obvious actions. Only the zones everyone meets (anywhere, toolbar). Plain words, no jargon, no shortcuts, no submenus.\nRules: at most 5 visible items per zone (rarely used ones go under one \"More…\" submenu), submenus at most 0 deep,\nno keyboard shortcuts, no developer jargon.\nEvery item names exactly one action id from the ACTIONS list; never invent an action. Labels are short verbs in plain English, icons are short lowercase names.\nReply with ONE JSON object and nothing else: {\"name\": \"...\", \"variant\": \"compact\"|\"roomy\"|\"glass\", \"targets\": {\"<zone id>\": [ {\"id\",\"label\",\"icon\",\"action\",\"shortcut\"?,\"rare\"?} | {\"id\",\"separator\":true} | {\"id\",\"label\",\"icon\",\"items\":[...]} ]}}.\nThe \"default\" zone is required. Mark items a user rarely needs with \"rare\": true so they fold away. Keep the menu slim: no wasted space.",
   "messages": [
    {
     "role": "user",
     "content": "APP: console-web\nZONES (3):\n- banner: Banner\n- default: Anywhere (default) (framework chrome) · right-click / long-press on anything that names no zone\n- toolbar: Toolbar (framework chrome) · every role=\"toolbar\"\nACTIONS (3):\n- nav:home: Home\n- nav:settings: Settings\n- edit.copy: Copy [framework]\nMap every zone listed. Reply with the JSON object only."
    }
   ],
   "level": "beginner",
   "zones": [
    "banner",
    "default",
    "toolbar"
   ],
   "actions": [
    "nav:home",
    "nav:settings",
    "edit.copy"
   ]
  },
  "prompt-advanced": {
   "system": "You design the right-click (context) menus of the \"console-web\" app of AmberX AXF for a ADVANCED CODER level user.\nLevel brief: A meticulous map of every zone with deep actions: tokens, API addresses, inspect, copy ids, run commands, open in the UI Manager. Submenus two deep. Everything still slim: rare items fold away.\nRules: at most 20 visible items per zone (rarely used ones go under one \"More…\" submenu), submenus at most 2 deep,\nshow keyboard shortcuts where an action has a known one, include developer actions (inspect, copy ids, console-control addresses, tokens, UI Manager, terminal).\nEvery item names exactly one action id from the ACTIONS list; never invent an action. Labels are short verbs in plain English, icons are short lowercase names.\nReply with ONE JSON object and nothing else: {\"name\": \"...\", \"variant\": \"compact\"|\"roomy\"|\"glass\", \"targets\": {\"<zone id>\": [ {\"id\",\"label\",\"icon\",\"action\",\"shortcut\"?,\"rare\"?} | {\"id\",\"separator\":true} | {\"id\",\"label\",\"icon\",\"items\":[...]} ]}}.\nThe \"default\" zone is required. Mark items a user rarely needs with \"rare\": true so they fold away. Keep the menu slim: no wasted space.",
   "messages": [
    {
     "role": "user",
     "content": "APP: console-web  PAGE: theme-manager\nZONES (7):\n- banner: Banner\n- default: Anywhere (default) (framework chrome) · right-click / long-press on anything that names no zone\n- toolbar: Toolbar (framework chrome) · every role=\"toolbar\"\n- asset-card: Asset Card (framework chrome)\n- nav: Navigation (framework chrome) · every <nav>\n- tab-group: Tab row (framework chrome) · every role=\"tablist\"\n- axf-todo-entry: Todo Entry (plugin todo-manager)\nACTIONS (9):\n- nav:home: Home\n- nav:settings: Settings\n- edit.copy: Copy [framework]\n- console.inspect: Inspect element\n- console.copy-id: Copy element id\n- console.copy-address: Copy console-control address\n- ui-manager.open: Open in the UI Manager\n- token-control.open: Tokens of this element\n- console-terminal.open: Open terminal here\nMap every zone listed. Reply with the JSON object only."
    }
   ],
   "level": "advanced",
   "zones": [
    "banner",
    "default",
    "toolbar",
    "asset-card",
    "nav",
    "tab-group",
    "axf-todo-entry"
   ],
